# Custom Lint Skill

When asked to create, update, or mechanize a custom lint rule in this repository, read the canonical project skill at `.agents/skills/custom-lint/SKILL.md` and follow it.

Use this rule for requests involving:

- new `scripts/check-*` repository checks
- pre-commit or CI gate changes
- semantic PR-diff lint
- regex, manifest, path/diff, or ESLint custom rules
- turning `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md` conventions into executable checks
